{"real": false, "dur": 73.77, "sent": [{"start": 0.4, "end": 6.55, "text": "So here’s the recipe, for anyone teaching a less commonly taught language or an Indigenous language.", "words": [{"w": "So", "s": 0.4}, {"w": "here’s", "s": 0.78}, {"w": "the", "s": 1.17}, {"w": "recipe,", "s": 1.55}, {"w": "for", "s": 1.94}, {"w": "anyone", "s": 2.32}, {"w": "teaching", "s": 2.71}, {"w": "a", "s": 3.09}, {"w": "less", "s": 3.48}, {"w": "commonly", "s": 3.86}, {"w": "taught", "s": 4.25}, {"w": "language", "s": 4.63}, {"w": "or", "s": 5.02}, {"w": "an", "s": 5.4}, {"w": "Indigenous", "s": 5.78}, {"w": "language.", "s": 6.17}]}, {"start": 6.9, "end": 7.29, "text": "One.", "words": [{"w": "One.", "s": 6.9}]}, {"start": 7.64, "end": 9.18, "text": "Start with your textbook.", "words": [{"w": "Start", "s": 7.64}, {"w": "with", "s": 8.02}, {"w": "your", "s": 8.41}, {"w": "textbook.", "s": 8.79}]}, {"start": 9.53, "end": 15.3, "text": "Identify what learners need to learn, and what they need to be able to do.", "words": [{"w": "Identify", "s": 9.53}, {"w": "what", "s": 9.91}, {"w": "learners", "s": 10.3}, {"w": "need", "s": 10.68}, {"w": "to", "s": 11.07}, {"w": "learn,", "s": 11.45}, {"w": "and", "s": 11.83}, {"w": "what", "s": 12.22}, {"w": "they", "s": 12.6}, {"w": "need", "s": 12.99}, {"w": "to", "s": 13.37}, {"w": "be", "s": 13.76}, {"w": "able", "s": 14.14}, {"w": "to", "s": 14.53}, {"w": "do.", "s": 14.91}]}, {"start": 15.65, "end": 16.03, "text": "Two.", "words": [{"w": "Two.", "s": 15.65}]}, {"start": 16.38, "end": 19.84, "text": "Make a list of exactly what your textbook teaches.", "words": [{"w": "Make", "s": 16.38}, {"w": "a", "s": 16.77}, {"w": "list", "s": 17.15}, {"w": "of", "s": 17.53}, {"w": "exactly", "s": 17.92}, {"w": "what", "s": 18.3}, {"w": "your", "s": 18.69}, {"w": "textbook", "s": 19.07}, {"w": "teaches.", "s": 19.46}]}, {"start": 20.19, "end": 27.12, "text": "Keep teaching and assessment within those limits, while allowing learners to encounter some new language along the way.", "words": [{"w": "Keep", "s": 20.19}, {"w": "teaching", "s": 20.58}, {"w": "and", "s": 20.96}, {"w": "assessment", "s": 21.35}, {"w": "within", "s": 21.73}, {"w": "those", "s": 22.12}, {"w": "limits,", "s": 22.5}, {"w": "while", "s": 22.88}, {"w": "allowing", "s": 23.27}, {"w": "learners", "s": 23.65}, {"w": "to", "s": 24.04}, {"w": "encounter", "s": 24.42}, {"w": "some", "s": 24.81}, {"w": "new", "s": 25.19}, {"w": "language", "s": 25.58}, {"w": "along", "s": 25.96}, {"w": "the", "s": 26.35}, {"w": "way.", "s": 26.73}]}, {"start": 27.47, "end": 27.85, "text": "Three.", "words": [{"w": "Three.", "s": 27.47}]}, {"start": 28.2, "end": 34.74, "text": "Give each linguistic goal its own lesson page, and create a few exercise formats you can reuse.", "words": [{"w": "Give", "s": 28.2}, {"w": "each", "s": 28.58}, {"w": "linguistic", "s": 28.97}, {"w": "goal", "s": 29.35}, {"w": "its", "s": 29.74}, {"w": "own", "s": 30.12}, {"w": "lesson", "s": 30.51}, {"w": "page,", "s": 30.89}, {"w": "and", "s": 31.28}, {"w": "create", "s": 31.66}, {"w": "a", "s": 32.05}, {"w": "few", "s": 32.43}, {"w": "exercise", "s": 32.82}, {"w": "formats", "s": 33.2}, {"w": "you", "s": 33.58}, {"w": "can", "s": 33.97}, {"w": "reuse.", "s": 34.35}]}, {"start": 35.09, "end": 35.47, "text": "Four.", "words": [{"w": "Four.", "s": 35.09}]}, {"start": 35.82, "end": 40.05, "text": "Write your own situations where your book doesn’t give you any.", "words": [{"w": "Write", "s": 35.82}, {"w": "your", "s": 36.21}, {"w": "own", "s": 36.59}, {"w": "situations", "s": 36.98}, {"w": "where", "s": 37.36}, {"w": "your", "s": 37.75}, {"w": "book", "s": 38.13}, {"w": "doesn’t", "s": 38.52}, {"w": "give", "s": 38.9}, {"w": "you", "s": 39.28}, {"w": "any.", "s": 39.67}]}, {"start": 40.4, "end": 43.48, "text": "No tool can do that part for you.", "words": [{"w": "No", "s": 40.4}, {"w": "tool", "s": 40.79}, {"w": "can", "s": 41.17}, {"w": "do", "s": 41.56}, {"w": "that", "s": 41.94}, {"w": "part", "s": 42.33}, {"w": "for", "s": 42.71}, {"w": "you.", "s": 43.1}]}, {"start": 43.83, "end": 44.22, "text": "Five.", "words": [{"w": "Five.", "s": 43.83}]}, {"start": 44.57, "end": 46.1, "text": "One exercise, more levels.", "words": [{"w": "One", "s": 44.57}, {"w": "exercise,", "s": 44.95}, {"w": "more", "s": 45.33}, {"w": "levels.", "s": 45.72}]}, {"start": 46.45, "end": 52.22, "text": "If something’s too easy or too hard, add a level and keep the same screen.", "words": [{"w": "If", "s": 46.45}, {"w": "something’s", "s": 46.84}, {"w": "too", "s": 47.22}, {"w": "easy", "s": 47.61}, {"w": "or", "s": 47.99}, {"w": "too", "s": 48.38}, {"w": "hard,", "s": 48.76}, {"w": "add", "s": 49.15}, {"w": "a", "s": 49.53}, {"w": "level", "s": 49.92}, {"w": "and", "s": 50.3}, {"w": "keep", "s": 50.68}, {"w": "the", "s": 51.07}, {"w": "same", "s": 51.45}, {"w": "screen.", "s": 51.84}]}, {"start": 52.57, "end": 52.96, "text": "Six.", "words": [{"w": "Six.", "s": 52.57}]}, {"start": 53.31, "end": 56.77, "text": "Write down your decisions and check the actual screens.", "words": [{"w": "Write", "s": 53.31}, {"w": "down", "s": 53.69}, {"w": "your", "s": 54.08}, {"w": "decisions", "s": 54.46}, {"w": "and", "s": 54.85}, {"w": "check", "s": 55.23}, {"w": "the", "s": 55.62}, {"w": "actual", "s": 56.0}, {"w": "screens.", "s": 56.38}]}, {"start": 57.12, "end": 62.5, "text": "Whether you’re working with AI or with a person, the teacher remains the author.", "words": [{"w": "Whether", "s": 57.12}, {"w": "you’re", "s": 57.5}, {"w": "working", "s": 57.89}, {"w": "with", "s": 58.27}, {"w": "AI", "s": 58.66}, {"w": "or", "s": 59.04}, {"w": "with", "s": 59.43}, {"w": "a", "s": 59.81}, {"w": "person,", "s": 60.2}, {"w": "the", "s": 60.58}, {"w": "teacher", "s": 60.97}, {"w": "remains", "s": 61.35}, {"w": "the", "s": 61.73}, {"w": "author.", "s": 62.12}]}, {"start": 62.85, "end": 65.55, "text": "French and Chinese are very different languages.", "words": [{"w": "French", "s": 62.85}, {"w": "and", "s": 63.24}, {"w": "Chinese", "s": 63.62}, {"w": "are", "s": 64.01}, {"w": "very", "s": 64.39}, {"w": "different", "s": 64.78}, {"w": "languages.", "s": 65.16}]}, {"start": 65.9, "end": 72.82, "text": "If the same approach works for both, that would be a good reason to try it with others.", "words": [{"w": "If", "s": 65.9}, {"w": "the", "s": 66.28}, {"w": "same", "s": 66.67}, {"w": "approach", "s": 67.05}, {"w": "works", "s": 67.43}, {"w": "for", "s": 67.82}, {"w": "both,", "s": 68.2}, {"w": "that", "s": 68.59}, {"w": "would", "s": 68.97}, {"w": "be", "s": 69.36}, {"w": "a", "s": 69.74}, {"w": "good", "s": 70.13}, {"w": "reason", "s": 70.51}, {"w": "to", "s": 70.9}, {"w": "try", "s": 71.28}, {"w": "it", "s": 71.67}, {"w": "with", "s": 72.05}, {"w": "others.", "s": 72.43}]}]}